    "message": "fix(hooks): name the PR workflow state in the audit write-guard's deny reason\n\nguard-audit-writes still named the retired .vergil/pr-template.yml as the USER agent's artifact. It now names .vergil/pr-workflow.json, the state report-ready writes. The test's rows use the new path and a new check asserts the deny reason names it and never the retired file. Ref #1374.",
