    },
    "message": "docs(site): describe the agent-submitted PR boundary across the plugin docs\n\nSweep items from vergil-project/vergil-tooling#4751 (epic vergil-project/.github#1384, ruling N0.35). The hooks reference, the skills reference and the README now say that the agent records its PR with report-ready, submits and finalizes it itself and watches it to the merge, with the relay kept for cloud sessions and releases and promotion staying human. The merge-review entry gains the record line, vrg-merge-review-close and the exemption; every docs, logbook and retrospective PR runs merge review and is agent-submitted, except that the human's submit stays the logbook's sign-off. pr-watch gains a failed: gates row, merge-review's error rule matches its routing table, fixture-run's in:title note is corrected, and skills-architecture.md is marked a historical record. Ref #1374.",
